{"content_hash": "731f90b2c2cdc218", "version_id": 913, "article_id": 92, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "MOUZ wins IEM Beijing 2026 without losing a single match", "title_zh": "MOUZ 一场未败，拿下 IEM 北京 2026 冠军", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/024/041.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589100957915-44c9c9228464?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bW91eiUyMGllbSUyMG1ham9yfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQxODYzNDR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by wu yi on Unsplash", "author": "wu yi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@takeshi2?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-and-white-bluetooth-earphones-vsCK6oPj5KY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(92, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(130, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "767cdf81a8f4"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-09", "word_count": 143, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "MOUZ beat The MongolZ 3:0 in the final of IEM Beijing 2026 and finished the event undefeated. Next up is BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong, the last big test before the Singapore Major.", "lead_zh": "MOUZ 在 IEM 北京 2026 决赛中以 3:0 击败 The MongolZ，并以全胜战绩夺冠。接下来是 BLAST 香港站，这是新加坡 Major 前最后一场重要热身。", "preview": "The Counter-Strike 2 event IEM Beijing 2026 ended on Sunday, and MOUZ took the trophy after a 3:0 win over The MongolZ in the final. Althoug", "preview_zh": "《反恐精英2》赛事 IEM 北京 2026 于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中以 3:0 战胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。虽然决赛看起来轻松，但 MOUZ 整周状态都很好，因为他们在本届赛事中一场未败。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 896, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 52.7, "size_bytes": 317088, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 53.475, "size_bytes": 321840, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 57.5, "size_bytes": 345888, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 50.075, "size_bytes": 301392, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 52.425, "size_bytes": 315504, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@07e7785/content/data/versions/913.json", "paragraphs": ["The Counter-Strike 2 event IEM Beijing 2026 ended on Sunday, and MOUZ took the trophy after a 3:0 win over The MongolZ in the final. Although the final looked easy, MOUZ had already shown strong form all week, because the team did not lose a single match at the event.", "NAVI finished third after beating BB 2:0 in the third-place match. However, the Chinese team TYLOO did not go far, as they ended the event in 9th to 12th place. For TYLOO, the result was a clear sign that more work is needed before bigger events.", "The next stop comes very soon, because BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 runs from 11 to 15 this month. It will be the last chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test new ideas before PGL Major Singapore 2026, so fans can expect serious matches."], "paragraphs_zh": ["《反恐精英2》赛事 IEM 北京 2026 于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中以 3:0 战胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。虽然决赛看起来轻松，但 MOUZ 整周状态都很好，因为他们在本届赛事中一场未败。", "NAVI 在季军赛中以 2:0 击败 BB，获得第三名。不过中国战队 TYLOO 没能走远，最终排在 9 至 12 名。对 TYLOO 来说，这个结果说明在更大的赛事前还需要更多努力。", "下一站比赛很快就到，因为 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026 将于本月 11 日至 15 日举行。这将是顶尖 CS2 战队在 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前最后一次练兵和尝试新打法的机会，所以粉丝可以期待认真的较量。"], "body": "The Counter-Strike 2 event IEM Beijing 2026 ended on Sunday, and MOUZ took the trophy after a 3:0 win over The MongolZ in the final. Although the final looked easy, MOUZ had already shown strong form all week, because the team did not lose a single match at the event.\n\nNAVI finished third after beating BB 2:0 in the third-place match. However, the Chinese team TYLOO did not go far, as they ended the event in 9th to 12th place. For TYLOO, the result was a clear sign that more work is needed before bigger events.\n\nThe next stop comes very soon, because BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 runs from 11 to 15 this month. It will be the last chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test new ideas before PGL Major Singapore 2026, so fans can expect serious matches.", "body_zh": "《反恐精英2》赛事 IEM 北京 2026 于周日落幕，MOUZ 在决赛中以 3:0 战胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。虽然决赛看起来轻松，但 MOUZ 整周状态都很好，因为他们在本届赛事中一场未败。\n\nNAVI 在季军赛中以 2:0 击败 BB，获得第三名。不过中国战队 TYLOO 没能走远，最终排在 9 至 12 名。对 TYLOO 来说，这个结果说明在更大的赛事前还需要更多努力。\n\n下一站比赛很快就到，因为 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026 将于本月 11 日至 15 日举行。这将是顶尖 CS2 战队在 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前最后一次练兵和尝试新打法的机会，所以粉丝可以期待认真的较量。", "text": "The Counter-Strike 2 event IEM Beijing 2026 ended on Sunday, and MOUZ took the trophy after a 3:0 win over The MongolZ in the final. Although the final looked easy, MOUZ had already shown strong form all week, because the team did not lose a single match at the event. NAVI finished third after beating BB 2:0 in the third-place match. However, the Chinese team TYLOO did not go far, as they ended the event in 9th to 12th place. For TYLOO, the result was a clear sign that more work is needed before bigger events. The next stop comes very soon, because BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026 runs from 11 to 15 this month. It will be the last chance for top CS2 teams to practise and test new ideas before PGL Major Singapore 2026, so fans can expect serious matches.", "vocab": [{"word": "undefeated", "pos": "adj", "zh": "全胜的，未败的", "note": "常与 finish / remain 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trophy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖杯", "note": "take the trophy 意为夺冠", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "final", "pos": "noun", "zh": "决赛", "note": "in the final 在决赛中", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "third-place match", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "季军赛", "note": "也可说 bronze medal match", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "form", "pos": "noun", "zh": "状态，竞技状态", "note": "in good form 状态好", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "go far", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "走得远，取得好成绩", "note": "常用于比赛或项目", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "noun", "zh": "迹象，信号", "note": "a sign that... 表示……的迹象", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stop", "pos": "noun", "zh": "一站（赛事）", "note": "next stop 下一站", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "practise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "练习，练兵", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 practice", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expect", "pos": "verb", "zh": "期待，预料", "note": "expect serious matches 期待激烈比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-09T01:05:42.896149", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Counter-Strike", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.962, "sm": 325, "em": 962, "cs": 4, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "2", "s": 0.963, "e": 1.175, "sm": 962, "em": 1175, "cs": 19, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "event", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.562, "sm": 1175, "em": 1562, "cs": 21, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "IEM